# A `.alters/` directory is a *project instance* that this package's own `mind init`
# scaffolds — config, catalog, run artifacts, memory, trees. This repo holds one because
# it dogfoods itself, but a package must not track the output of its own scaffolder: the
# shipped defaults live in `packages/cli/profiles/default/`, and everything under
# `.alters/` is local working state. Tests build their own `.alters/` inside a temp dir,
# so nothing in the suite depends on this one existing.
.alters/

# Agent worktrees and local session state.
.claude/
